---
title: "Event Storming: Холтер-мониторинг установлен пациенту"
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph CLINIC[Clinic Domain]
        APP[Appointment Context]
        INV[Inventory Context]
    end

    subgraph FINTECH[FinTech Domain]
        PAY[Payment Context]
    end

    subgraph STREAMING[Streaming Domain]
        PREP[Telemetry Preparation Context]
        PROC[Telemetry Processing Context]
    end

    subgraph MEDICINE[Medicine Domain]
        REC[Medical Records Context]
    end

    APP -.->|HolterAssigned| INV
    APP -.->|HolterAssigned| PAY
    APP -.->|HolterAssigned| PREP
    APP -.->|HolterAssigned| REC

    INV -->|ReserveDevice| INV

    PREP -->|CreateTelemetrySession| PROC

    PROC -.->|partial replicate: TelemetryData| REC